  "name": "arcane_circle",
  "_comment": "Arcane library with a painted sigil on the floor, authored in WALL pixels (1080x1920). arcane_circle.png is 816x1440; it is upscaled once to arcane_circle_wall.png (uniform 4/3, centred, 4 px cropped per side) so the canvas equals the screen and there is no per-frame smoothscale. Each rect is the source coordinate x 4/3 minus the 4 px crop. Source features: floor sigil centre (400,1065) radius ~220; left desk candles x 60..140 y 600..695 and x 265..325 y 590..685; right desk candles x 690..750 y 590..685; hanging lantern x 405..450 y 200..280; open books x 130..280 y 630..780 and x 480..620 y 610..760; green flask x 645..685 y 630..675; blue round flask x 470..515 y 645..700; gothic window x 340..520 y 230..470. The rune ring is deliberately centred on the painted sigil so the floor circle looks alive rather than duplicated.",
